-- Wider news read for each seat: Ruto's Pioneer housing handover in Eldoret (18 October 2026).
-- Written by Groundwork from the reporting linked in each row; places, never people.
begin;

For the opposition''s likely candidate this is an opening more than a threat. The Nation reads the Rift tour as Ruto shoring up home ground to make up for regions that have left UDA, with apathy, not defection, his risk there. He is campaigning every day with a delivery story; the opposition still has no candidate. The housing levy is paid by every salaried worker in every county, but the keys went to Eldoret: that gap between who pays and who gets is the argument.', '["Never attack the homes: people want houses. Attack the deal: ''You pay the levy in Machakos and Nairobi. Who got the keys?''", "Use it to press the opposition for a single candidate now: Ruto is already on the road with a slogan and a showcase.", "Ask, county by county, where the levy-funded homes are, and publish the answer.", "Keep everything short of open campaigning until 29 May 2027: IEBC''s rule binds the opposition too."]'::jsonb, '[{"label": "Nation: Ruto takes re-election pitch to Eldoret, defends UDA\u2013ODM pact", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/news/politics/ruto-takes-re-election-pitch-to-eldoret-home-turf-defends-uda-odm-pact-5636008", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Nation: why Ruto pitched camp in his Rift Valley stronghold", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/weekly-review/why-president-ruto-pitched-camp-in-his-rift-valley-stronghold-5635980", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Capital FM: Ruto hands over keys to 2,157 homeowners", "url": "https://capitalfm.africa/ruto-hands-over-keys-to-2157-homeowners-at-sh5-3bn-eldoret-housing-project/", "date": "2026-10-18"}, {"label": "K24: Mwakideu under fire over praise for the estate", "url": "https://k24.digital/entertainment/celebrity/alex-mwakideu-under-fire-over-praise-for-rutos-eldoret-affordable-housing-project", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "The Star: IEBC, no campaigns before 29 May 2027", "url": "https://www.the-star.co.ke/news/2026-08-20-iebc-no-campaigns-before-may-29-2027", "date": "2026-08-20"}]'::jsonb, 'Groundwork') on conflict do nothing;

For Nairobi''s governor, an ally of the programme, this is an opening: the president has shown that handing over keys makes the news. The risk is that Nairobi is where the levy bites hardest on salaried renters and where ''who can afford it?'' is asked loudest, so a showcase in Eldoret with nothing comparable in the city reads as the city paying for the Rift.', '["Find the Nairobi units that are finished or nearly so, ward by ward, and get a handover in the city, with keys in residents'' hands, well before the campaign period.", "Answer ''who can afford it?'' with Nairobi''s own numbers: who qualified, what they pay a month, how the social units were allocated.", "Put city jobs on the sites (the Jua Kali doors in Eldoret are the template) at the front of the story."]'::jsonb, '[{"label": "Nation: Ruto takes re-election pitch to Eldoret, defends UDA\u2013ODM pact", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/news/politics/ruto-takes-re-election-pitch-to-eldoret-home-turf-defends-uda-odm-pact-5636008", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Capital FM: Ruto hands over keys to 2,157 homeowners", "url": "https://capitalfm.africa/ruto-hands-over-keys-to-2157-homeowners-at-sh5-3bn-eldoret-housing-project/", "date": "2026-10-18"}, {"label": "K24: Mwakideu under fire over praise for the estate", "url": "https://k24.digital/entertainment/celebrity/alex-mwakideu-under-fire-over-praise-for-rutos-eldoret-affordable-housing-project", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Nation: inside Eldoret''s Sh5.37bn housing project", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/counties/uasin-gishu/inside-eldoret-s-sh5-37bn-housing-project-2-157-homes-104-shops-and-a-new-way-of-living-5637176", "date": "2026-10-19"}]'::jsonb, 'Groundwork') on conflict do nothing;

In Mathira this lands as context with an edge. The Nation reads the Rift tour as Ruto making up for regions that have left UDA, and Mt Kenya is the obvious one. Pictures of the Rift getting homes feed the story DCP campaigns on: that the region was used and left. Nyeri was itself promised a Ksh21bn housing programme in January.', '["Don''t defend or attack the president over it; in Gachagua''s home seat that only helps the DCP ticket.", "Ask in public where Nyeri''s promised homes are and when they will be handed over: a local question, not a national quarrel.", "Keep the fortnight on Mathira''s own issues: coffee and tea prices, water, jobs for the young."]'::jsonb, '[{"label": "Nation: why Ruto pitched camp in his Rift Valley stronghold", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/weekly-review/why-president-ruto-pitched-camp-in-his-rift-valley-stronghold-5635980", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Capital FM: Ruto hands over keys to 2,157 homeowners", "url": "https://capitalfm.africa/ruto-hands-over-keys-to-2157-homeowners-at-sh5-3bn-eldoret-housing-project/", "date": "2026-10-18"}, {"label": "People Daily: Ruto''s goodies to regain Mt Kenya", "url": "https://peopledaily.digital/inside-politics/inside-rutos-goodies-to-regain-mt-kenya-turf-amid-heightened-realignment", "date": "2026-01-20"}]'::jsonb, 'Groundwork') on conflict do nothing;

For Githunguri, context more than threat. The Nation reads the Rift tour as Ruto shoring up his base because Mt Kenya has drifted, and Kiambu''s salaried commuters pay the levy while the keys went to Eldoret. That feeds the regional mood DCP rides. Your line is to fight DCP''s candidates, not Gachagua, and the same holds for the president: argue about Githunguri, not about him.', '["Ask where Kiambu''s levy-funded homes are, how many, and when: a question about this county, put in public.", "Tie it to the farm gate: ''Houses in Eldoret are fine; milk at a fair price in Githunguri is what we need.''", "Watch Listening for ''housing levy'' posts from the seat and answer the angry ones."]'::jsonb, '[{"label": "Nation: why Ruto pitched camp in his Rift Valley stronghold", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/weekly-review/why-president-ruto-pitched-camp-in-his-rift-valley-stronghold-5635980", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Nation: Ruto takes re-election pitch to Eldoret, defends UDA\u2013ODM pact", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/news/politics/ruto-takes-re-election-pitch-to-eldoret-home-turf-defends-uda-odm-pact-5636008", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "K24: Mwakideu under fire over praise for the estate", "url": "https://k24.digital/entertainment/celebrity/alex-mwakideu-under-fire-over-praise-for-rutos-eldoret-affordable-housing-project", "date": "2026-10-19"}]'::jsonb, 'Groundwork') on conflict do nothing;

Roysambu is a ward of tenants and students, where housing is the issue and demolitions are the fear. The Eldoret pictures raise the question every tenant here asks: could I ever get one of those, and at what price? The Eldoret programme itself came with reports of families facing eviction for the land. A ward candidate who answers that question on the street owns it.', '["Hold a tenants'' meeting on affordable housing: how to apply on Boma Yangu, what a unit costs, who qualifies.", "Record which streets fear demolition and stand with them first: presence beats parties here.", "Ask the county where Nairobi''s units are and how Roysambu residents get a fair share."]'::jsonb, '[{"label": "Capital FM: Ruto hands over keys to 2,157 homeowners", "url": "https://capitalfm.africa/ruto-hands-over-keys-to-2157-homeowners-at-sh5-3bn-eldoret-housing-project/", "date": "2026-10-18"}, {"label": "K24: Mwakideu under fire over praise for the estate", "url": "https://k24.digital/entertainment/celebrity/alex-mwakideu-under-fire-over-praise-for-rutos-eldoret-affordable-housing-project", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Standard: thousands face eviction in Eldoret as state eyes land for housing (Jan 2025)", "url": "https://www.standardmedia.co.ke/rift-valley/article/2001509993/thousands-face-eviction-in-eldoret-as-state-eyes-more-land-for-housing", "date": "2025-01-20"}]'::jsonb, 'Groundwork') on conflict do nothing;

In Athwana, Kindiki''s backyard, this is context: the president''s ticket is campaigning on delivery, and Tigania West has had its own, the 10,807 title deeds handed out at New Kiare. The Rift tour shows the 2027 campaign will be fought on what was delivered where. For a ward race won on presence, the question is whether the deeds and promises reached people''s hands.', '["Ask at the doors: has your title deed arrived? Note who is still waiting and take the list to the lands office.", "Speak of delivery in the ward''s terms: roads, water, the market, the title deeds.", "Stay off the national quarrel; a ward won by 111 votes is won on presence."]'::jsonb, '[{"label": "Nation: Ruto takes re-election pitch to Eldoret, defends UDA\u2013ODM pact", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/news/politics/ruto-takes-re-election-pitch-to-eldoret-home-turf-defends-uda-odm-pact-5636008", "date": "2026-10-19"}, {"label": "Capital FM: Ruto hands over keys to 2,157 homeowners", "url": "https://capitalfm.africa/ruto-hands-over-keys-to-2157-homeowners-at-sh5-3bn-eldoret-housing-project/", "date": "2026-10-18"}, {"label": "Nation: Ruto unveils new UDA slogan on Rift tour", "url": "https://nation.africa/kenya/news/politics/foul-or-fair-play-ruto-goes-hard-on-opponents-as-he-unveils-new-uda-slogan-in-rift-tour-5630752", "date": "2026-10-17"}]'::jsonb, 'Groundwork') on conflict do nothing;
commit;
